Note on MiniPedia Content Separation:
- Built-in MiniPedia studio articles (`minipedia-cnsw.json`, stored in IndexedDB `minipedia_mit`) are written by Kehai Interim, ConsciousNode SoftWorks, and licensed under the MIT License above.
- Any Wikipedia abstract dump (`*-abstract.xml`) imported by the operator at runtime is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0), attributed on every page as "Text from Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0" with its source URL, and stored/exported in a separate IndexedDB store (`minipedia_wiki`) so the licenses never mix.
